ed recursively, `xmlXIncludeIncludeNode` frees B (if XML_PARSE_NOXINCNODE set) or frees B\'s children (non-NOXINCNODE)\n  - After recursive processing, outer `xmlXIncludeLoadFallback` accesses `fallback->children` which may contain freed nodes\n  - Also identified: after B is freed during recursive processing, the outer `xmlXIncludeDoProcess`\'s second phase later calls `xmlXIncludeLoadNode(ctxt, B)` which accesses freed B — direct UAF\n- Determined `XML_PARSE_NOXINCNODE = 1<<15 = 32768`, so opts = 1024 | 32768 = 33792\n- Constructed PoC XML:\n  ```xml\n  <doc xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">\n    <xi:include href="nonexistent1.xml">\n      <xi:fallback>\n        <xi:include href="nonexistent2.xml">\n          <xi:fallback>\n            <child>content</child>\n          </xi:fallback>\n        </xi:include>\n      </xi:fallback>\n    </xi:include>\n  </doc>\n  ```\n- Generated `/workspace/poc1.bin` with correct format:\n  - opts = 0x8400 (33792) little-endian\n  - URL "doc.xml" + `\\` + newline\n  - Content + `\\` + newline\n  - Verified bytes: `00 84 00 00 64 6f 63 2e 78 6d 6c 5c 0a` (correct)\n- Re-verified fuzzer harness input format by reading `/workspace/_work/src/fuzz/xml.c` and `/workspace/_work/src/fuzz/fuzz.c`:\n  - `xmlFuzzReadInt()` reads 4-byte opts\n  - `xmlFuzzReadEntities()` reads URL/content pairs terminated by `\\` + newline\n  - `xmlFuzzEntityLoader` looks up URLs in entities hash; returns NULL if not found (causing load failure and fallback processing)\n  - Main entity is first URL/content pair\n- Confirmed the PoC design is correct: nonexistent1.xml and nonexistent2.xml are not in the entities hash, so their loads fail, triggering fallback processing\n- Reviewed build.sh and submit.sh scripts:\n  - build.sh sends build commands to remote server via HTTP POST\n  - submit.sh validates candidate_trace.json format (requires step, file, function, line, var, code, note fields; consecutive steps; no depends_on), copies PoC and trace to `.subm